WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.166
- Well I saw you posted
a photo of how you handle

00:00:02.166 --> 00:00:03.410
(dog barks) spit up.

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:04.243
And I--

00:00:04.243 --> 00:00:06.415
Oh sorry, my dog just barked
at my husband so apparently

00:00:06.415 --> 00:00:07.399
he senses evil
- It's okay.

00:00:07.399 --> 00:00:08.391
Our dog just might bark soon

00:00:08.391 --> 00:00:10.037
- [Kelly] (laughs)

00:00:10.037 --> 00:00:11.630
No sorry he keeps barking,

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:15.020
but no I saw this photo that you posted

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.540
and you're already just given up on shirts

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:19.260
cause like you've got vomit going

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.129
down the back of you. (laughs)

00:00:21.129 --> 00:00:22.780
- You know what's funny
is someone asked me

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:23.613
that the other day.

00:00:23.613 --> 00:00:26.520
They go, "do you ever wear
a shirt?" and I'm at home.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.890
The answer is not most of the time

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:30.480
because I guess when I
work out at the house,

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:31.470
I don't workout with a shirt on

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:33.730
and then I don't shower
until seven o'clock at night

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:35.623
and I just kinda leave the shirt off.

00:00:35.623 --> 00:00:36.930
Especially when I'm holding the baby

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:38.290
I mean there's no point in ruining

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:39.620
you know eight shirts during the day.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:43.300
I think my wife changes about
17 times just from spit up so.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:44.133
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:45.370
I gave up on nice things.

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:46.850
I just own black or white.

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:47.768
I'm just like whatever.

00:00:47.768 --> 00:00:50.809
So I saw a video of showing you outdoors

00:00:50.809 --> 00:00:52.293
while you're quarantining.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.440
What were you doing in a tree?

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.710
Like I saw this video of
you like trying to swing

00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:59.472
like it's Tarzan like what?

00:00:59.472 --> 00:01:01.288
Who's that deal with that?

00:01:01.288 --> 00:01:02.960
- [Thomas] We just moved into a new house

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:04.391
and we were kind of exploring outside

00:01:04.391 --> 00:01:07.650
and my wife noticed this
vine hanging from the tree

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.580
and my kids were trying to swing on it.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:11.460
And Lauren was like, "I use
to do that when I was little"

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.760
and she was like, "well let me go try it"

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:14.420
and I said, "how bout you
go let me try it first

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.560
just to make sure that it's like stable."

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:18.290
And so I like yanked on it a couple times

00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:20.070
and it felt fine and
then like I went for it

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:21.500
and the limb just snapped in half

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.076
and I think I bruised my tailbone

00:01:24.076 --> 00:01:27.100
and I'm really embarrassed that
Lauren caught that on video,

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:30.237
but you know that's
just what we do around.

